  "reflectionText": "Jesus sat on the mountainside above Galilee and named the ones who would be blessed: the poor in spirit, the mourners, the gentle, the hungry, the merciful, the pure, the peacemakers, the persecuted. How does it land to be called blessed in the very condition you had thought was the far edge from blessing?"
